  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainability of the HIV Response in the Republic of Cuba - Cuba (01-Jan-2018-31-Dec-2020)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cuba, HIV, United Nations Development Programme (UNDP Cuba)This program has the following goals: To reduce the incidence of HIV and STIs among key populations, with an emphasis on MSM.. The objectives of this program are: Fortalecer el acceso equitativo a paquetes de servicios integrales de VIH en un entorno de respeto a las diferentes orientaciones sexuales  y la igualdad de g&#xe9;nero.  Contribuir a la resiliencia y sostenibilidad del sistema de salud cubano</narrative>
  </description>
